only `domains` and gated only definitions whose `actorAspect` is Present (12 actors — the dreams Editor, the thirteenth, sits under
`draco/dreams`, outside the scan), its comment calling the plain and rule mods types "a later pass". That pass never
came. So the EMIT direction of 60 mods surfaces — the staged dreams and service trios, the Editor among them, the sentient eleven, the five domain objects, the reports, intents and
coordinates — was pinned by nothing but the hand-run `DrakeCLI check`; DrakeParseTest pins `emit(parse(source))`
for the example tree only, and DreamsTest, InitializationTest and ServiceTest pin their own surfaces by name. The
same shape of gap the fixpoint assertion closed the day before: a claim every increment's record made and no
suite asserted as a whole.

